{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2023-05-30 09:00:00', 'title': 'DUPONT INTRODUCES SOLDERON™ BP TS 7000 CHEMISTRY AS NEWEST ADDITION TO THE TIN-SILVER PLATING BATH FAMILY', 'text': 'NEWLY REDESIGNED LEAD-FREE FORMULATION\xa0DELIVERS INDUSTRY-LEADING PLATING RATES, ENHANCED PLATING PERFORMANCE, BATH STABILITY AND GREATER PROCESS FLEXIBILITY FOR ADVANCED PACKAGING APPLICATIONS WILMINGTON, DEL. , MAY 30, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUPONT ELECTRONICS & INDUSTRIAL TODAY INTRODUCED DUPONT™ SOLDERON™\xa0BP TS 7000, THE LATEST INNOVATION IN TIN-SILVER PLATING CHEMISTRY, AT THE IEEE ELECTRONIC COMPONENTS AND TECHNOLOGY CONFERENCE (ECTC) IN ORLANDO, FLORIDA.'}